From 2e683c8e1dbfdd58753619674e368fae4ef8deb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PeterChamp <peter@maszatai.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 03:41:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] Add 24h hourly temperature band chart overlay with
 settings toggle

- Fetch hourly=temperature_2m from Open-Meteo (2-day window), slice 24h from current local hour
- Band chart: colored bands (blue->warm yellow by normalized temp, 35% alpha), dots, thin white line, temp labels every hour, hour numbers every 3rd hour
- Transparent black strip (rgba 0,0,0,0.35) at top of scene, hidden when data missing or toggle off
- Settings toggle '24-hour chart' localized in all 9 languages, default ON, persisted
